<div class="grid">

  <!-- ======================= HEADER ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="regime-radar">
    <div class="topline">
      <h1>{{ t('Macro Regime Dashboard', '宏观周期仪表盘') }}</h1>
      <span class="badge quad-{{ latest.quad }}">{{ td(latest.quad_name) }}</span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip tip-map">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>The four market regimes</b> — combinations of growth and inflation direction.
        (Sometimes written Q1–Q4, but these are <b>quadrants, NOT calendar quarters</b>.)
        <span class="qgrid">
          <span class="qax"></span>
          <span class="qax">inflation falling ↓</span>
          <span class="qax">inflation rising ↑</span>
          <span class="qax">growth<br>rising ↑</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q1' }}" style="background:var(--q1)">GOLDILOCKS<br><small>best for tech & quality</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q2' }}" style="background:var(--q2);color:#1a1a1a">REFLATION<br><small>cyclicals, energy, banks</small></span>
          <span class="qax">growth<br>falling ↓</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q4' }}" style="background:var(--q4)">GROWTH SCARE<br><small>defensives & bonds</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q3' }}" style="background:var(--q3)">STAGFLATION<br><small>the dangerous one</small></span>
        </span>
        The label changes only after 7 straight days of evidence (or one extreme shock day),
        so it doesn't flip-flop. Today's regime is outlined in white.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>四种市场周期</b> — 增长方向与通胀方向的组合。
        （有时写作 Q1–Q4，但这是<b>象限，而非日历季度</b>。）
        <span class="qgrid">
          <span class="qax"></span>
          <span class="qax">通胀下行 ↓</span>
          <span class="qax">通胀上行 ↑</span>
          <span class="qax">增长<br>上行 ↑</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q1' }}" style="background:var(--q1)">理想增长<br><small>最利好科技与质量</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q2' }}" style="background:var(--q2);color:#1a1a1a">再通胀<br><small>周期股、能源、银行</small></span>
          <span class="qax">增长<br>下行 ↓</span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q4' }}" style="background:var(--q4)">增长恐慌<br><small>防御板块与债券</small></span>
          <span class="qcell{{ ' qcur' if latest.quad == 'Q3' }}" style="background:var(--q3)">滞胀<br><small>最危险的那一种</small></span>
        </span>
        标签只有在连续 7 天证据一致（或单日极端冲击）后才会改变，
        因此不会反复横跳。今日周期以白色边框标出。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="badge state-{{ latest.transition_state }}">{{ td(latest.transition_state) }}</span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>The transition radar</b> — is the current regime ending? It escalates as warning
        signals stack up:
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--muted)">⚪ <b>STABLE</b> — no warnings. Trust the regime label.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">🟠 <b>WEAKENING</b> — 2+ warnings. Stop adding regime-dependent bets.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--orange)">🔶 <b>TRANSITIONING</b> — 3+ warnings. The regime is likely ending before the label flips — reduce risk now.</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">🚨 <b>NEW REGIME</b> — the label changed within the last week.</span>
        The warnings: thinning participation, nervous credit, risk-ratios turning, inflation
        trades turning, signal disagreement, fragile options positioning.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>转换雷达</b> — 当前周期是否正在结束？随着预警信号累积而升级：
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--muted)">⚪ <b>稳定</b> — 无预警。信任周期标签。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">🟠 <b>走弱</b> — 2 个以上预警。停止加注依赖周期的押注。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--orange)">🔶 <b>转换中</b> — 3 个以上预警。周期很可能在标签翻转之前就已结束 — 立即降低风险。</span>
        <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">🚨 <b>新周期</b> — 标签在过去一周内已改变。</span>
        预警包括：参与度变薄、信用市场紧张、风险比率反转、通胀交易反转、信号分歧、期权仓位脆弱。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('signal agreement', '信号一致度') }} <b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Signal agreement</b> — how many of the ~14 underlying indicators point the
        same way. Today: <b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b>.
        <span class="scale">
          <span style="background:var(--down)">MIXED</span>
          <span style="background:var(--warn)">OK</span>
          <span style="background:var(--up)">SOLID</span>
        </span>
        <span class="sl"><span>0%</span><span>30%</span><span>45%</span><span>100%</span></span>
        <b>Mixed</b>: the indicators disagree — expect chop, size down, trust the radar
        more than the label. <b>OK</b>: usable with caution. <b>Solid</b>: the regime
        call is well-supported.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>信号一致度</b> — 约 14 个底层指标中有多少指向同一方向。
        今日：<b>{{ (latest.confidence * 100) | round | int }}%</b>。
        <span class="scale">
          <span style="background:var(--down)">分歧</span>
          <span style="background:var(--warn)">尚可</span>
          <span style="background:var(--up)">扎实</span>
        </span>
        <span class="sl"><span>0%</span><span>30%</span><span>45%</span><span>100%</span></span>
        <b>分歧</b>：指标互相矛盾 — 预期震荡，缩小仓位，相信雷达多于标签。
        <b>尚可</b>：可用，但需谨慎。<b>扎实</b>：周期判断有充分支撑。
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('Fed liquidity', '美联储流动性') }} <b>{{ td(latest.liquidity_overlay) }}</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Fed liquidity</b> — net money flowing into or out of the financial system
        (Fed balance sheet − reverse-repo parking − the government's checking account),
        measured as a 4-week trend.
        <table>
          <tr><th></th><th>meaning</th><th>history says</th></tr>
          <tr><td>🟢 <b>expanding</b></td><td>money tide rising</td><td>the most reliable tailwind we tested: stocks up ~73% of months</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⚪ <b>neutral</b></td><td>roughly flat</td><td>no signal</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🔴 <b>contracting</b></td><td>money draining</td><td>persistent headwind — be choosier</td></tr>
        </table>
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>美联储流动性</b> — 净流入或流出金融系统的资金
        （美联储资产负债表 − 逆回购停泊 − 政府活期账户），以 4 周趋势衡量。
        <table>
          <tr><th></th><th>含义</th><th>历史显示</th></tr>
          <tr><td>🟢 <b>扩张</b></td><td>资金潮上涨</td><td>我们测试过最可靠的顺风：股市约 73% 的月份上涨</td></tr>
          <tr><td>⚪ <b>中性</b></td><td>大致持平</td><td>无信号</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🔴 <b>收缩</b></td><td>资金流失</td><td>持续逆风 — 需更挑剔</td></tr>
        </table>
        </span>
      </span></span>
      <span class="kv">{{ t('cycle', '商业周期') }} <b>{{ td(latest.cycle_tag) }}</b></span>
      <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>Business-cycle position</b> — the multi-year backdrop (from the yield curve,
        credit spreads and market breadth). Slower-moving than the regime.
        <table>
          <tr><td>🌱 <b>early</b></td><td>recovering after stress — historically the best risk/reward</td></tr>
          <tr><td>☀️ <b>mid</b></td><td>expansion cruising — normal conditions</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🌇 <b>late</b></td><td>curve inverted/flattening, breadth thinning — enjoy it, but keep one eye on the exit</td></tr>
        </table>
        Context only — it sizes your patience, not your trades.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>商业周期位置</b> — 多年期的大背景（来自收益率曲线、信用利差与市场广度）。
        比周期标签变化更慢。
        <table>
          <tr><td>🌱 <b>早期</b></td><td>压力后复苏 — 历史上风险回报最佳</td></tr>
          <tr><td>☀️ <b>中期</b></td><td>扩张平稳推进 — 正常环境</td></tr>
          <tr><td>🌇 <b>晚期</b></td><td>曲线倒挂／走平，广度变薄 — 享受它，但留意出口</td></tr>
        </table>
        仅作背景参考 — 它决定你的耐心，而非你的交易。
        </span>
      </span></span>
    </div>
    <details class="howto">
      <summary>{{ t('New here? How to read this page in 60 seconds', '初次访问？60 秒读懂本页') }}</summary>
      <div>
        <span class="l-en">
        <b>1.</b> The colored badge is the market regime — the "weather" (not a calendar quarter!). The second badge is the transition radar — whether that weather is about to change.<br>
        <b>2.</b> <b>Where we are</b> shows how far along this regime likely is. <b>What's likely next</b> gives the historical odds of each path and what to do about it. <b>How to trade it</b> turns today's conditions into a posture and concrete names.<br>
        <b>3.</b> Everything below that is supporting evidence. Hover any <span class="help">?</span> for a plain-English explanation. <span class="pos">Green = risk-friendly</span>, <span class="neg">red = risk-hostile</span>.<br>
        <b>4.</b> This is a context machine with measured odds, not a crystal ball.
        </span>
        <span class="l-zh">
        <b>1.</b> 彩色徽章是市场周期 — 即"天气"（不是日历季度！）。第二个徽章是转换雷达 — 这种天气是否即将改变。<br>
        <b>2.</b> <b>我们身处何处</b>显示当前周期大致走到哪一步。<b>接下来可能发生什么</b>给出每条路径的历史概率及应对方式。<b>如何交易</b>把今日条件转化为持仓姿态与具体标的。<br>
        <b>3.</b> 其下的所有内容都是佐证。将鼠标悬停在任意 <span class="help">?</span> 上可获得通俗解释。<span class="pos">绿色 = 风险友好</span>，<span class="neg">红色 = 风险敌对</span>。<br>
        <b>4.</b> 这是一台带有量化概率的背景分析机器，而非水晶球。
        </span>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== REGIME TIME MACHINE ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="time-machine">
    <h2>{{ t('⏳ Regime time machine', '⏳ 周期时光机') }}
      {{ help("Drag the playhead across ~28 years of history and the readout below rewinds the regime CORE to that day — quadrant, growth/inflation scores, signal agreement, liquidity, business-cycle position and the warning flags that were firing. (Sector, holdings & playbook panels lower down aren't stored historically, so they always show today.) Hit ▶ to play the regime forward through time and watch the quad ribbon flip at every major turn — 2008, 2020, 2022.", "拖动播放头横扫约 28 年历史，下方读数会把周期核心回退到那一天 — 象限、增长／通胀分数、信号一致度、流动性、商业周期位置，以及当天触发的预警旗。（下方的板块、持仓与剧本面板不作历史存储，故始终显示今日。）点击 ▶ 让周期随时间向前播放，看周期色带在每个重大转折处翻转 — 2008、2020、2022。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="tm-wrap">
      <canvas id="tm-canvas" class="tm-canvas"></canvas>
      <input id="tm-range" class="tm-range" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0"
             aria-label="Scrub regime history">
    </div>
    <div class="tm-controls">
      <button class="tm-btn tm-play" id="tm-play" aria-label="play/pause"
              title="Play / pause through time">
        <span class="tm-play-ico"></span>
      </button>
      <span class="tm-presets">
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="now">{{ t('Now', '现在') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2022-06-16">{{ t('2022 bear', '2022 熊市') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2020-03-23">{{ t('2020 COVID', '2020 疫情') }}</button>
        <button class="tm-btn" data-tm-jump="2008-11-20">{{ t('2008 GFC', '2008 金融危机') }}</button>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="tm-readout">
      <div class="tm-asof">
        <span class="tm-date" id="tm-date">—</span>
        <span class="tm-state-tag is-live" id="tm-tag">—</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-badges">
        <span class="badge" id="tm-quad">—</span>
        <span class="badge" id="tm-trans">—</span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('agreement', '一致度') }} <b id="tm-conf">—</b></span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('cycle', '商业周期') }} <b id="tm-cyc">—</b></span>
        <span class="kv">{{ t('liquidity', '流动性') }} <b id="tm-liq">—</b></span>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-gauges">
        <div class="tm-gauge">
          <div class="tm-glabel"><span>{{ t('Growth', '增长') }}</span><span class="muted" id="tm-g-v">—</span></div>
          <div class="gauge"><i id="tm-g-i" style="left:50%"></i></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tm-gauge">
          <div class="tm-glabel"><span>{{ t('Inflation', '通胀') }}</span><span class="muted" id="tm-i-v">—</span></div>
          <div class="gauge"><i id="tm-i-i" style="left:50%"></i></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tm-flags" id="tm-flags"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if alerts %}
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('Fired alerts (today)', '已触发警报（今日）') }}
      {{ help("Alerts fire only when something CHANGES — a warning level escalating, a crossing, a sign flip — never just because a level is high. They're rare by design; read every one. Click any alert to jump to the scorecard it came from.", "警报只在某物发生变化时触发 — 预警级别升级、出现交叉、符号翻转 — 绝不仅因某个水平偏高而触发。它们刻意设计得稀少；每一条都要读。点击任意警报可跳转到其来源的计分卡。") }}
    </h2>
    {% for a in alerts %}
      <a class="alert alert-{{ a.severity }}" {% if a.anchor %}href="#{{ a.anchor }}"{% endif %}>
        <div class="alert-head">
          <span class="alert-ico">{{ a.icon }}</span>
          <b><span class="l-en">{{ a.plain_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.plain_zh }}</span></b>
          {% if a.anchor %}<span class="alert-jump">{{ t('View scorecard ↓', '查看计分卡 ↓') }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        <div class="alert-detail"><span class="l-en">{{ a.message }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.message_zh or a.message }}</span></div>
        <div class="alert-what"><span class="l-en">{{ a.what_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.what_zh }}</span></div>
        {% if a.edge_en %}<div class="alert-edge"><b>{{ t('Conviction:', '可信度：') }}</b> <span class="l-en">{{ a.edge_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ a.edge_zh or a.edge_en }}</span></div>{% endif %}
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= ACTION BOARD ======================= -->
  {% if action_board %}
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>⚡ {{ t('What to act on now', '当前可操作') }}
      {{ help("Your at-a-glance starting point. Built from each sector's own price cycle (and standout individual stocks): what's a confirmed buy today, what's setting up to buy within a few days, what to take profits on, and what to leave alone. 'Days' are rough trajectory estimates, not promises. Click any name for the full breakdown.", "你的一眼总览起点。基于每个板块自身的价格周期（及表现突出的个股）：今日已确认的买入、几天内即将构筑的买入、需止盈的、以及该放手不管的。'天数'是粗略的轨迹估计，并非承诺。点击任意名称查看完整拆解。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="actiongrid">
      <div class="actcol act-buy">
        <div class="acth">🟢 {{ t('BUY ZONE — confirmed now', '买入区 — 已确认') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.buy_now %}
          <a class="actitem" href="sectors/{{ x.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.age_short %}<span class="actage">⏱ {{ t(x.age_short, x.age_short_zh) }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="acttag">{{ td(x.label) }}</span></a>
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('None today — nothing has fully confirmed a fresh cycle low.', '今日无 — 尚无标的完全确认新的周期低点。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-soon">
        <div class="acth">🔵 {{ t('SETTING UP — buy soon', '构筑中 — 即将买入') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.buy_soon %}
          <a class="actitem" href="sectors/{{ x.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.days is not none %}<span class="acteta">~{{ x.days }}d</span>{% endif %}</a>
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('No imminent setups.', '暂无临近的构筑。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-trim">
        <div class="acth">🟠 {{ t('TAKE PROFITS / topping', '止盈／做顶') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.take_profits %}
          <a class="actitem" href="sectors/{{ x.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ x.ticker }}</span>{% if x.age_short %}<span class="actage">⏱ {{ t(x.age_short, x.age_short_zh) }}</span>{% endif %}<span class="acttag">{{ td(x.label) }}</span></a>
        {% else %}<p class="muted sm">{{ t('Nothing topping.', '无标的做顶。') }}</p>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="actcol act-hold">
        <div class="acth">⚪ {{ t('HOLD / avoid', '持有／回避') }}</div>
        {% for x in action_board.hold %}
          <a class="actitem" href="sectors/{{ x.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ t("hold — don't chase", '持有 — 勿追高') }}</span></a>
        {% endfor %}
        {% for x in action_board.avoid %}
          <a class="actitem" href="sectors/{{ x.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ td(x.name) }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ t("wait", '等待') if x.tag == "WAIT" else t("avoid", '回避') }}</span></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if action_board.notable %}
    <div class="notable">
      <span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{ t('Standout individual stocks (from sector top-10s):', '表现突出的个股（来自各板块前十大持仓）：') }}</span>
      {% for n in action_board.notable %}
        <a class="chip {{ 'chip-pos' if n.urgency in ('now','imminent') else 'chip-neg' }}" href="stock.html#{{ n.ticker }}">{{ n.ticker }} · {{ td(n.label) }}{% if n.urgency == 'imminent' and n.days %} (~{{ n.days }}d){% endif %}{% if n.age_short %} · ⏱{{ t(n.age_short, n.age_short_zh) }}{% endif %}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:11.5px; margin-top:8px">⚠ {{ t("Cycle-timing signals are about <i>where in the price cycle</i> a sector is — most useful combined with the regime read above. Our calibration shows these states don't beat buy-and-hold on average return; their value is structure and risk placement (entry + a defined exit), not certainty.", "周期择时信号关乎一个板块<i>处于价格周期的哪个位置</i> — 与上方的周期判读结合使用最有价值。我们的校准显示这些状态在平均回报上并不能跑赢买入持有；它们的价值在于结构与风险摆位（入场 + 明确的出场），而非确定性。") }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= NOW ======================= -->
  {% if pb %}
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('Where we are in this regime', '我们身处此周期何处') }}
      {{ help("Compares this regime's age against every " + latest.quad_name + " period since 2007 in this exact classifier. Regimes don't die of old age — but the older one gets relative to history, the more weight every warning flag deserves.", "将此周期的年龄与自 2007 年以来本分类器中每一段 " + latest.quad_name + " 周期对比。周期不会因年老而自然消亡 — 但相对历史越老，每一面预警旗都越值得加重看待。") }}
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size:14.5px; margin: 2px 0 6px"><b>{{ t(pb.quad_meaning.en, pb.quad_meaning.zh) }}.</b></p>
    {% if pb.progress %}
    <div class="lifebar">
      <div class="zone" style="left:0; width:{{ pb.progress.zone_early_pct }}%; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--up) 35%, var(--panel))"></div>
      <div class="zone" style="left:{{ pb.progress.zone_early_pct }}%; width:{{ pb.progress.zone_mid_pct - pb.progress.zone_early_pct }}%; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 35%, var(--panel))"></div>
      <div class="zone" style="left:{{ pb.progress.zone_mid_pct }}%; width:{{ 100 - pb.progress.zone_mid_pct }}%; background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--down) 35%, var(--panel))"></div>
      <div class="marker" style="left:{{ pb.progress.bar_pct }}%"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="lifelabels"><span>{{ t('young', '年轻') }}</span><span>{{ t('mid-life', '中年') }}</span><span>{{ t('old', '年老') }}</span></div>
    <p style="margin:10px 0 4px"><b>{{ t(pb.progress.phase | upper, tr(pb.progress.phase)) }}</b> — {{ t(pb.progress.phase_note, pb.progress.phase_note_zh) }}.</p>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:4px 0">
      <span class="l-en">
      {{ pb.progress.age_days }} trading days in, vs a median of {{ pb.progress.median_days }}
      across {{ pb.progress.n_history }} past {{ latest.quad_name }} periods.
      {{ pb.progress.pct_longer | round | int }}% of them lasted longer than this one has so far{% if pb.progress.median_remaining_days %} —
      and those that did typically ran another ~{{ pb.progress.median_remaining_days }} trading days
      (≈{{ (pb.progress.median_remaining_days / 5) | round(1) }} weeks){% endif %}.
      </span>
      <span class="l-zh">
      已运行 {{ pb.progress.age_days }} 个交易日，对比 {{ pb.progress.n_history }} 段过往 {{ td(latest.quad_name) }} 周期的中位数 {{ pb.progress.median_days }} 个交易日。
      其中 {{ pb.progress.pct_longer | round | int }}% 比当前这一段持续得更久{% if pb.progress.median_remaining_days %} —
      而那些更久的通常还会再运行约 {{ pb.progress.median_remaining_days }} 个交易日
      （≈{{ (pb.progress.median_remaining_days / 5) | round(1) }} 周）{% endif %}。
      </span>
      {{ help("Historical base rates from this classifier's own 2007-present history — odds and typical paths, not predictions. A young regime + STABLE radar = let winners run. An old regime + warnings = the odds of a shift compound.", "来自本分类器自身 2007 年至今历史的基础概率 — 是概率与典型路径，而非预测。年轻周期 + 稳定雷达 = 让赢家继续奔跑。年老周期 + 预警 = 转变的概率层层叠加。") }}
    </p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="muted">{{ t('Not enough regime history for lifespan statistics yet.', '周期历史尚不足以做寿命统计。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= NEXT ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t("What's likely next — and how to trade it", '接下来可能发生什么 — 以及如何交易') }}
      {{ help("Simple historical frequencies: across every " + latest.quad_name + " period since 2007, which regime came next. These are base rates, not forecasts — but they tell you which playbook to keep warm. The watch names below are NOT buys yet; the evidence says anticipating rotations loses money — wait for the trend to confirm.", "简单的历史频率：自 2007 年以来每一段 " + latest.quad_name + " 周期之后，接下来出现的是哪个周期。这些是基础概率，而非预测 — 但能告诉你该把哪套剧本备着。下方的观察标的目前还不是买入；证据表明提前押注轮动会亏钱 — 等趋势确认。") }}
    </h2>
    {% for n in pb.next_list %}
    <div class="prob">
      <span class="nm">{{ td(n.name) }}</span>
      <span class="bar"><i style="width:{{ n.prob_pct }}%; background: var(--q{{ n.code[1] }})"></i></span>
      <span class="pc">{{ n.prob_pct }}%</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if pb.watchlist %}
      <h3>{{ t('Accumulation watchlist for that shift', '为该转变准备的吸筹观察名单') }}</h3>
      {% for x in pb.watchlist %}
        <div class="card"><span class="calltag tag-watch">{{ td("WATCH — DON'T BUY YET") }}</span>
          <b class="tk">{{ x.ticker }}</b> · {{ td(x.name) }}<br>
          <span class="muted">{{ t(x.why, x.why_zh) }}</span></div>
      {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
    <h3>{{ t('The signals that would announce the shift', '将预告该转变的信号') }}</h3>
    <ul class="compact muted">
      {% for trg_en, trg_zh in pb.triggers %}<li>{{ t(trg_en, trg_zh) }}</li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= TRADE IT ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12">
    <h2>{{ t('How to trade the current regime', '如何交易当前周期') }}
      {{ help("Built from conditions that held up in both halves of a 2007-2026 backtest. The dial is the headline: how much risk current conditions support. Sector calls below it are risk filters and confirmation tools — our research found no stable 'this sector will outperform' signal at monthly horizons, so anyone selling you that is curve-fitting.", "基于在 2007–2026 回测前后两半都站得住脚的条件构建。刻度盘是核心：当前条件支持多大的风险。其下的板块判断是风险过滤器与确认工具 — 我们的研究在月度时间尺度上未发现稳定的'某板块将跑赢'信号，所以任何向你兜售此类信号的人都是在过拟合。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="dial">
      {% for p in ["DEFENSIVE","CAREFUL","NEUTRAL","CONSTRUCTIVE","AGGRESSIVE"] %}
        <span class="{{ 'active-' + p if pb.dial.posture == p }}">{{ td(p) }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% for sign, r_en, r_zh in pb.dial.reasons %}
      <div class="reason"><b class="sig sig-{{ {'+':'p','-':'m','i':'i'}[sign] }}">{{ {'+':'+','-':'−','i':'i'}[sign] }}</b> {{ t(r_en, r_zh) }}</div>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:12px">
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>✅ {{ t('Confirmed leadership — where participation is real', '已确认的领先 — 参与度真实之处') }}
          {{ help("Sectors in an established uptrend vs the market with momentum still positive and not yet stretched. Descriptive — where the market's money already is. Use it to place exposure you already intend to take.", "相对市场处于既定上涨趋势、动量仍为正且尚未过度拉伸的板块。这是描述性的 — 市场资金已经在哪里。用它来摆放你本就打算建立的敞口。") }}
        </h3>
        {% for x in pb.leaders %}
          <div class="card"><span class="calltag tag-lead">{{ t('LEADER', '领先') }}</span>
            <b class="tk">{{ x.ticker }}</b> · {{ td(x.name) }}<br>
            <span class="muted">{{ t(x.why, x.why_zh) }}</span></div>
        {% else %}
          <p class="muted">{{ t('No sector currently qualifies — leadership is either stretched or unconfirmed. That itself is information: stay close to the index.', '当前无板块合格 — 领先地位要么已过度拉伸，要么尚未确认。这本身就是信息：紧贴指数。') }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
        {% if pb.momentum_tilt.tickers %}
          <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{ t('Longer-horizon tilt:', '较长时间尺度倾斜：') }} <b>
            {%- for t in pb.momentum_tilt.tickers %}{{ t.ticker }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor -%}
          </b> {{ help(pb.momentum_tilt.note, pb.momentum_tilt.note_zh) }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="span6">
        <h3>🚫 {{ t("Avoid right now — the evidence-backed don'ts", '现在回避 — 有证据支撑的禁忌') }}
          {{ help("The strongest findings in our sector backtest were about what NOT to do: chasing stretched leaders lost 55% of the time; buying below-trend bounces lost in every variant tested. These warnings carry more statistical weight than any buy signal on this page.", "我们板块回测中最强的发现都是关于不该做什么：追逐过度拉伸的领先股有 55% 的时间亏钱；买入趋势下方的反弹在测试的每个变体中都亏钱。这些警告比本页任何买入信号都带有更大的统计权重。") }}
        </h3>
        {% for x in pb.avoid %}
          <div class="card"><span class="calltag tag-avoid">{{ td(x.call) }}</span>
            <b class="tk">{{ x.ticker }}</b> · {{ td(x.name) }}<br>
            <span class="muted">{{ t(x.why, x.why_zh) }}</span></div>
        {% else %}
          <p class="muted">{{ t('Nothing currently triggers the avoid rules.', '当前没有任何标的触发回避规则。') }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px; margin-top:8px">⚖️ {{ t(pb.honesty, pb.honesty_zh) }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ======================= SIGNALS ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span6" id="dials">
    <h2>{{ t('The two dials behind the regime', '周期背后的两个刻度盘') }}
      {{ help("The regime label comes from two scores between -1 and +1, built from market prices (which lead) plus a small weight on economic data (which confirms). Growth above zero + inflation below zero = Goldilocks, and so on. The white marker is today.", "周期标签来自两个介于 -1 与 +1 之间的分数，由市场价格（领先）加上经济数据（确认）的小幅权重构建。增长高于零 + 通胀低于零 = 理想增长，以此类推。白色标记代表今日。") }}
    </h2>
    <p style="margin:8px 0 0"><b>{{ t('Growth:', '增长：') }} {{ t("RISING", '上行') if latest.growth_score >= 0 else t("FALLING", '下行') }}</b>
      <span class="muted">({{ "%+.2f" | format(latest.growth_score) }} {{ t('of ±1 · agreement', '／±1 · 一致度') }} {{ (latest.growth_confidence * 100) | round | int }}%)</span>
      {{ help("Is the economy's growth impulse improving or deteriorating, as priced by markets: copper vs gold, consumer discretionary vs staples, small vs large caps, cyclical vs defensive sectors, the 2-year yield, breadth — confirmed slowly by payrolls and industrial production.", "经济的增长动能正在改善还是恶化，以市场定价衡量：铜对黄金、可选消费对必需消费、小盘对大盘、周期板块对防御板块、2 年期收益率、市场广度 — 由非农就业与工业产出缓慢确认。") }}
    </p>
    <div class="gauge"><i style="left: {{ ((latest.growth_score + 1) / 2 * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
    <p style="margin:10px 0 0"><b>{{ t('Inflation pressure:', '通胀压力：') }} {{ t("RISING", '上行') if latest.inflation_score >= 0 else t("FALLING", '下行') }}</b>
      <span class="muted">({{ "%+.2f" | format(latest.inflation_score) }} {{ t('of ±1 · agreement', '／±1 · 一致度') }} {{ (latest.inflation_confidence * 100) | round | int }}%)</span>
      {{ help("Is inflation pressure building or cooling, as priced by markets: bond-market inflation expectations, oil, energy-sector strength, and inflation-winner vs inflation-loser sector baskets.", "通胀压力正在累积还是降温，以市场定价衡量：债市通胀预期、原油、能源板块强度，以及通胀受益板块对通胀受损板块的组合。") }}
    </p>
    <div class="gauge"><i style="left: {{ ((latest.inflation_score + 1) / 2 * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>

    <h3>{{ t("What's voting for this regime", '哪些指标在为此周期投票') }}
      {{ help("Each chip is one indicator inside the two dials. Green chips point WITH the regime call; red chips point AGAINST it. Lots of red = shaky ground (and lower 'signal agreement').", "每个标签代表两个刻度盘中的一个指标。绿色标签与周期判断同向；红色标签与之反向。红色越多 = 根基越不稳（且'信号一致度'越低）。") }}
    </h3>
    <div>
      {% for c in components_confirming %}<span class="chip chip-pos">{{ c }}</span>{% endfor %}
      {% for c in components_contradicting %}<span class="chip chip-neg">{{ c }}</span>{% endfor %}
      {% if not components_confirming and not components_contradicting %}<span class="muted">{{ t('all quiet', '一切平静') }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>

    <h3>{{ t('Weakest link', '最薄弱环节') }}
      {{ help("Of everything currently supporting the regime call, this indicator is closest to flipping sides — the single thing most likely to change the picture.", "在当前支撑周期判断的所有指标中，这一个最接近倒戈 — 是最有可能改变全局的单一因素。") }}
    </h3>
    <p class="muted">{{ flip_plain }}</p>

    {% if latest.preference_check %}
    <h3>{{ t('Does the market agree with the regime?', '市场是否认同此周期？') }}
      {{ help("The regime implies certain sectors should lead. This checks whether they actually ARE. Agreement strengthens the call; disagreement is an early warning — when the tape stops cooperating with the story, the story is often about to change.", "此周期暗示某些板块应当领先。这里检验它们是否真的在领先。一致会强化判断；分歧则是早期预警 — 当盘面不再配合剧情时，剧情往往即将改变。") }}
    </h3>
    <p class="muted">{{ latest.preference_check.note }}
      {% if latest.preference_check.actual_ranks %}
        <span class="l-en">({% for t, r in latest.preference_check.actual_ranks.items() %}{{ t }} is #{{ r }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %} of {{ latest.sector_rs | length }})</span><span class="l-zh">（{% for t, r in latest.preference_check.actual_ranks.items() %}{{ t }} 排名第 {{ r }}{{ "，" if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}，共 {{ latest.sector_rs | length }} 个）</span>
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= INTERNALS ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('Market internals — risk appetite gauges', '市场内部结构 — 风险偏好计') }}
      {{ help("Simple ratios between two assets; each answers a question about investor mood. Direction over the last 20 days matters more than the level. Green = moved in the risk-friendly direction.", "两类资产之间的简单比率；每一个都回答一个关于投资者情绪的问题。过去 20 天的方向比绝对水平更重要。绿色 = 朝风险友好的方向移动。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('gauge', '指标') }}</th><th>{{ t('past month', '过去一月') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t("what it's saying", '它在说什么') }}</th></tr>
      {% for r in internals %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ r.label }} {{ help(r.tip) }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if r.good else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.2f" | format(r.chg) }}%</td>
        <td class="l muted">{{ r.verdict }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= SECTOR HEAT BOARD ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="sectors">
    <h2>{{ t('Sector heat board — regime × tape × technicals × seasonality', '板块热度榜 — 周期 × 盘面 × 技术 × 季节性') }}
      {{ help("One row per sector, everything that matters in one place. HEAT (0-100) measures how CONFIRMED a sector's strength is right now: regime fit + rotation stage + technicals, minus crowding. Important: heat describes the present, not the future — our 2007-2026 backtest shows the hottest band (70+) actually UNDERPERFORMED over the following months (everything-confirmed usually means late). So: high heat = hold/trim territory, never a fresh-entry signal; the buy workflow is the watchlist + trigger column.", "每个板块一行，把重要的一切放在一处。热度（0–100）衡量一个板块的强势此刻有多被确认：周期契合度 + 轮动阶段 + 技术面，减去拥挤度。重要：热度描述的是现在，而非未来 — 我们 2007–2026 的回测显示最热的区间（70+）在随后几个月反而跑输（万事俱备通常意味着已晚）。因此：高热度 = 持有／减仓区，绝非新建仓信号；买入流程靠观察名单 + 触发列。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
        <th class="l" style="min-width:130px">{{ t('heat', '热度') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>Heat</b> = how CONFIRMED a sector's strength is (regime fit + trend stage +
          technicals − crowding). Hover each bar for its exact arithmetic.
          <table>
            <tr><th>band</th><th>read it as</th><th>measured 3-month record*</th></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--orange)"><b>70+ OVERHEATED</b></td><td>late — hold/trim, don't start</td><td>beat market 47% (−0.6% avg)</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--up)"><b>55-69 HOT</b></td><td>confirmed — hold, buy pullbacks</td><td>49% (−0.3%)</td></tr>
            <tr><td><b>40-54 NEUTRAL</b></td><td>mixed, no lean</td><td>49% (−0.1%)</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--info)"><b>0-39 COLD</b></td><td>washed out — wait for trigger</td><td>50% (+0.2%)</td></tr>
          </table>
          *vs the index, every week 2007-2026. Note the inversion: hot sectors were
          usually LATE. That measured record is the trust level — and it argues
          against chasing.
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>热度</b> = 一个板块的强势有多被确认（周期契合度 + 趋势阶段 +
          技术面 − 拥挤度）。将鼠标悬停在每个条上可查看其精确算式。
          <table>
            <tr><th>区间</th><th>解读为</th><th>实测 3 个月记录*</th></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--orange)"><b>70+ 过热</b></td><td>已晚 — 持有／减仓，勿入场</td><td>跑赢市场 47%（平均 −0.6%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--up)"><b>55-69 偏热</b></td><td>已确认 — 持有，回调时买入</td><td>49%（−0.3%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td><b>40-54 中性</b></td><td>混合，无倾向</td><td>49%（−0.1%）</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="color:var(--info)"><b>0-39 偏冷</b></td><td>已洗盘 — 等待触发</td><td>50%（+0.2%）</td></tr>
          </table>
          *对比指数，2007–2026 每一周。注意这种反转：偏热的板块通常都已晚。
          这份实测记录就是可信度 — 它反对追高。
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('stage', '阶段') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>The rotation cycle</b> — every sector travels this loop vs the market:
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--info)">1. IMPROVING — momentum turns up, trend not yet confirmed. <b>Too early</b>: buying here lost money historically.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--up)">2. LEADING — confirmed uptrend. The healthy zone.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">3. WEAKENING — still above trend but losing steam. Tighten stops.</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">4. LAGGING — downtrend. Avoid until it improves again.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>轮动周期</b> — 每个板块相对市场都会走完这个循环：
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--info)">1. 改善 — 动量转上，趋势尚未确认。<b>过早</b>：历史上在这里买入会亏钱。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--up)">2. 领先 — 已确认上涨趋势。健康区。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--warn)">3. 走弱 — 仍在趋势上方但动能减弱。收紧止损。</span>
          <span class="lad lad-tint" style="--c:var(--down)">4. 落后 — 下跌趋势。回避，直到再度改善。</span>
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('3mo vs market', '3 月对比市场') }} {{ help("How much it beat or trailed the S&P 500 over the past 60 trading days — the medium-term relative trend the playbook keys off.", "过去 60 个交易日内它跑赢或落后标普 500 多少 — 剧本所依据的中期相对趋势。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('technicals', '技术面') }} <span class="help">?<span class="tip">
          <span class="l-en">
          <b>RSI(14)</b> — a 0-100 momentum thermometer:
          <span class="scale">
            <span style="background:var(--g-cold)">OVERSOLD</span>
            <span style="background:var(--muted)">SOFT</span>
            <span style="background:var(--up)">HEALTHY</span>
            <span style="background:var(--down)">HOT</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sl"><span>0</span><span>30</span><span>45</span><span>70</span><span>100</span></span>
          <b>✓/✗ 200d and 50d</b>: whether price is above its 200-day (long-term) and
          50-day (medium-term) average — the most basic "is it in an uptrend" filters.
          Green row = both ✓.
          </span>
          <span class="l-zh">
          <b>RSI(14)</b> — 一个 0–100 的动量温度计：
          <span class="scale">
            <span style="background:var(--g-cold)">超卖</span>
            <span style="background:var(--muted)">疲软</span>
            <span style="background:var(--up)">健康</span>
            <span style="background:var(--down)">过热</span>
          </span>
          <span class="sl"><span>0</span><span>30</span><span>45</span><span>70</span><span>100</span></span>
          <b>✓/✗ 200日 与 50日</b>：价格是否高于其 200 日（长期）与
          50 日（中期）均线 — 最基本的"是否处于上涨趋势"过滤器。
          绿色行 = 两者皆 ✓。
          </span>
        </span></span></th>
        <th>{{ t('seasonality', '季节性') }} {{ help("This sector's average return in the current calendar month (and how often that month closed up). Hover any value for the full 12-month picture — a chart plus a table, with this month highlighted. Weak evidence by nature: background context only, never a signal on its own, and deliberately left out of the heat score.", "该板块在当前日历月的平均回报（以及该月收涨的频率）。将鼠标悬停在任意数值上可查看完整的 12 个月全貌 — 图表加表格，并高亮当前月份。本质上是弱证据：仅作背景参考，绝不单独作为信号，并已刻意排除在热度分数之外。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('to trigger', '距触发') }} {{ help("For sectors below their long-term relative trend: how much more outperformance vs SPY is needed for the trend to cross (= the data-backed buy confirmation), and how far along it already is from its recent low. Small gap + high progress = watch closely.", "对于低于其长期相对趋势的板块：还需相对 SPY 多跑赢多少趋势才会交叉（= 有数据支撑的买入确认），以及从近期低点起已走了多远。差距小 + 进度高 = 密切观察。") }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('cycle timing', '周期择时') }} {{ help("From the sector's own price cycle (click the sector name for the full drill-down): where it sits in its ~36-42 trading-day cycle and how many of its top-10 holdings are in a buy setup (BOTTOMING or BUY ZONE). The per-state historical base rates live on the drill-down page.", "来自板块自身的价格周期（点击板块名称查看完整下钻）：它处于约 36–42 个交易日周期的哪个位置，以及其前十大持仓中有多少处于买入构筑（筑底中或买入区）。各状态的历史基础概率见下钻页面。") }}</th>
      </tr>
      {% for r in sector_rows %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><a href="sectors/{{ r.ticker }}.html"><b>{{ r.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ td(r.name) }}</span></td>
        <td class="l" data-sort="{{ r.heat }}">
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0;border-radius:6px">
            <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;cursor:help">
              <span style="display:inline-block;width:64px;height:9px;background:var(--panel2);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden"><i style="display:block;height:100%;width:{{ r.heat }}%;background:{{ r.heat_color }}"></i></span>
              <b>{{ r.heat }}</b>
              <span class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ td(r.heat_label) }}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="tip">{{ r.heat_tip }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
        <td><span class="pill stg-{{ r.stage }}">{{ td(r.stage) }}</span></td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if r.mom_60d_pct > 0 else 'neg' }}" data-sort="{{ r.mom_60d_pct }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(r.mom_60d_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if r.tech_ok else '' }}" style="font-size:12px">{{ r.tech_str }}</td>
        <td>
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0">
            <span style="cursor:help">{{ r.season_str }}</span>
            <span class="tip tip-seas">{{ r.season_tip }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
        <td>{{ r.trigger_str }}</td>
        <td>
          {% if r.timing_state %}
            <span class="pill st-{{ r.timing_state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(r.timing_label) }}</span>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px">{{ r.timing_note }}</div>
          {% else %}—{% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{ t('Click any sector for its full drill-down: cycle position, multi-timeframe momentum, and each top-10 holding analyzed individually.', '点击任意板块查看完整下钻：周期位置、多时间尺度动量，以及逐一分析的每个前十大持仓。') }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="panel span6">
    <h2>{{ t('Commodities & macro tape', '大宗商品与宏观盘面') }}
      {{ help("The non-equity instruments the regime engine watches, with their technicals and seasonal tendency. No heat score here — regime alignment and rotation stages are equity-sector concepts.", "周期引擎所关注的非股票类标的，及其技术面与季节性倾向。这里没有热度分数 — 周期契合度与轮动阶段是股票板块的概念。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('instrument', '标的') }}</th><th>{{ t('trend', '趋势') }}</th><th>RSI</th><th>{{ t('off 52w high', '距52周高') }}</th><th>{{ t('3mo', '3月') }}</th><th>{{ t('seasonal', '季节性') }}</th></tr>
      {% for c in commodities %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><b>{{ td(c.name) }}</b></td>
        <td>{{ "✓" if c.above200 else "✗" }}200d {{ "✓" if c.above50 else "✗" }}50d</td>
        <td>{{ c.rsi14 | round | int if c.rsi14 is not none else "—" }}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'neg' if c.off_52w_high_pct < -10 else '' }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(c.off_52w_high_pct) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if c.mom_60d_pct > 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(c.mom_60d_pct) }}%</td>
        <td>
          <span class="help" style="width:auto;height:auto;border:none;margin:0">
            <span style="cursor:help">{{ (c.season_this or "—").split(":")[1].split("avg")[0].strip() if c.season_this else "—" }}</span>
            <span class="tip">{{ c.season_this or t("Not enough history.", "历史数据不足。") }}</span>
          </span>
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="panel span6" id="liquidity">
    <h2>{{ t('Fed liquidity — the money tide', '美联储流动性 — 资金潮') }}
      {{ help("Top: net money in the system (Fed balance sheet minus reverse-repo minus the Treasury's account), in billions. Bottom: its 4-week change — the impulse. Green above the dotted line = expanding (historically the most reliable tailwind); red below = contracting.", "上方：系统内的净资金（美联储资产负债表减逆回购减财政部账户），单位十亿。下方：其 4 周变化 — 即动能。虚线之上为绿色 = 扩张（历史上最可靠的顺风）；下方为红色 = 收缩。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="chart">{{ chart_liquidity | safe }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel span6" id="credit">
    <h2>{{ t('Credit stress & market breadth', '信用压力与市场广度') }}
      {{ help("Top: the extra yield junk-bond investors demand — the market's best early smoke detector; rising = stress building; below ~4% is calm. Bottom: % of S&P 500 stocks above their 50-day average — participation. Strong indexes with collapsing breadth are fragile.", "上方：垃圾债投资者要求的额外收益率 — 市场最好的早期烟雾探测器；上行 = 压力累积；低于约 4% 为平静。下方：标普 500 中高于其 50 日均线的股票占比 — 即参与度。指数走强而广度崩塌则脆弱。") }}
    </h2>
    <div class="chart">{{ chart_credit_breadth | safe }}</div>
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= POSITIONING ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span6" id="positioning">
    <h2>{{ t("Who's positioned how — the crowd meter", '谁如何持仓 — 拥挤度计') }}
      {{ help("What different investor groups are currently doing, shown as a position on each dial. The middle is normal; the ENDS are the danger zones — when a marker sits at either extreme, that trade is crowded and prone to violent reversal. Hover each name for the underlying numbers.", "不同投资者群体当前在做什么，以每个刻度盘上的位置呈现。中间为正常；两端是危险区 — 当标记落在任一极端时，该交易已拥挤且易发生剧烈反转。将鼠标悬停在每个名称上可查看底层数字。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('who / what', '谁／什么') }}</th><th class="l" style="min-width:150px">{{ t('where they stand', '当前位置') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('what it means', '含义') }}</th></tr>
      {% for p in positioning %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ p.name }} {{ help(p.tip) }}</td>
        <td class="l">
          {% if p.pct is not none %}
            <div class="pgauge"><i style="left: {{ p.pct | round(1) }}%"></i></div>
            <div class="pends"><span>{{ p.left }}</span><span>{{ p.right }}</span></div>
          {% else %}
            <span class="plabel {{ 'plabel-hot' if 'amplif' in p.label or 'hedg' in p.label or 'complacent' in p.label else 'plabel-norm' }}">{{ p.label }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="l muted">
          {% if p.pct is not none %}<b style="color:var(--text)">{{ p.label }}</b>{% if p.verdict %} — {{ p.verdict }}{% endif %}
          {% else %}{{ p.verdict }}{% endif %}
        </td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= ACCUMULATION WATCH ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="accumulation">
    <h2>{{ t('🐳 Accumulation watch — sector ETFs', '🐳 增持监测 — 板块 ETF') }}
      {{ help("Each sector SPDR's top-10 weights, with each holding's weight change split into the part explained by the stock's own price move and a residual ('active' = weight that grew MORE than price alone). A large positive residual = real buying flowed into the name beyond market drift. HONEST CAVEAT: these SPDRs are PASSIVE index funds, so the residual is index reconstitution / float-weight flow (forced index-fund buying), NOT a discretionary manager's conviction — that reading comes with the active funds in the planned top-200 page. The technical column shows the stock's own cycle state; ✅ marks accumulation that also has a forming buy setup. Thresholds are uncalibrated until more snapshot history accumulates.", "每只板块 SPDR 的前十大权重；每只持仓的权重变动被拆分为“由个股自身价格变动解释的部分”与“残差”（“主动”=权重增长超过价格涨幅的部分）。较大的正残差=除市场漂移外确有真实买盘流入该股。诚实提示：这些 SPDR 是被动指数基金，故残差代表指数再平衡／流通权重调整带来的资金流（被动强制买入），并非主动经理的信念——后者要等到计划中的前 200 ETF 页面里的主动基金。技术面列显示个股自身的周期状态；✅ 表示增持同时出现了正在形成的买入形态。在积累更多快照历史前，阈值尚未校准。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if accumulation %}
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th class="l">{{ t('sector', '板块') }}</th>
          <th class="l">{{ t('stock', '个股') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('raw Δwt', '原始权重Δ') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('active Δwt', '主动权重Δ') }}</th>
          <th>{{ t('est. flow', '估算资金流') }}</th>
          <th class="l">{{ t('technical', '技术面') }}</th>
        </tr>
        {% for a in accumulation %}
        <tr>
          <td class="l muted">{{ a.fund }} · {{ td(a.sector) }}</td>
          <td class="l"><a href="stock.html#{{ a.ticker }}"><b>{{ a.ticker }}</b></a> <span class="muted">{{ a.name }}</span></td>
          <td class="{{ 'pos' if a.raw_change >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.2f" | format(a.raw_change) }}pp</td>
          <td class="{{ 'pos' if a.active_change >= 0 else 'neg' }}"><b>{{ "%+.2f" | format(a.active_change) }}pp</b></td>
          <td class="muted">{{ a.flow_str }}</td>
          <td class="l">
            {% if a.ladder %}<span class="pill st-{{ a.ladder.state | replace(' ', '_') }}">{{ td(a.ladder.label) }}</span>{% if a.confirmed %} ✅{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}{% if a.vol and a.vol.surging %} <span title="volume {{ a.vol.ratio }}× its recent average">📊</span>{% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px">{{ t('“Active Δwt” strips out price: it is the percentage points of weight a name gained beyond what its own price move explains. On passive index ETFs this captures index reconstitution / float-weight flow, not a manager’s discretion. The estimated $ flow applies the active Δwt to the fund’s AUM and is approximate.', '“主动权重Δ”已剔除价格因素：它是个股权重增长中超出其自身价格涨幅所能解释的百分点。在被动指数 ETF 上，这反映的是指数再平衡／流通权重调整带来的资金流，而非经理人的主动决策。估算的美元资金流是将“主动权重Δ”乘以基金 AUM 得出的近似值。') }}</p>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('Building — needs at least two daily holdings snapshots per fund (collection began 2026-06-11). Decomposed accumulation signals appear once a second snapshot lands.', '构建中 — 每只基金至少需要两个每日持仓快照（采集自 2026-06-11 开始）。第二个快照落地后将显示拆解后的增持信号。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= HOLDINGS / FLOWS ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="holdings">
    <h2>{{ t("Star fund managers' real moves", '明星基金经理的真实动作') }}
      {{ help("Daily holdings of the watchlist funds (ARK etc.) with mechanical flow effects stripped out — what's left is genuine manager conviction, visible the day after they trade.", "观察名单基金（ARK 等）的每日持仓，已剔除机械性的资金流影响 — 剩下的是真正的经理人信念，在他们交易后的次日可见。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if holdings_changes %}
      <table>
        <tr><th class="l">{{ t('fund', '基金') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('position', '仓位') }}</th><th>{{ t('active chg', '主动变动') }}</th><th>{{ t('window', '窗口') }}</th></tr>
        {% for h in holdings_changes %}
        <tr><td class="l">{{ h.fund }}</td><td class="l">{{ h.position }}</td>
            <td class="{{ 'pos' if h.pct > 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+.1f" | format(h.pct) }}%</td>
            <td class="muted">{{ h.window }}</td></tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </table>
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('No significant manager moves in the current window (needs a few trading days of snapshots).', '当前窗口内无显著的经理人动作（需要数个交易日的快照）。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    <h2 style="margin-top:16px">{{ t('Where ETF money is flowing', 'ETF 资金流向何处') }}
      {{ help("Daily money in/out of each sector's main ETF, from share creations/redemptions (ΔShares × price). Positive = money entering. History builds from June 2026.", "每个板块主力 ETF 的每日资金进出，来自份额的申购／赎回（份额变动 × 价格）。正值 = 资金进入。历史自 2026 年 6 月起累积。") }}
    </h2>
    {% if flows_html %}
      {{ flows_html | safe }}
    {% else %}
      <p class="muted">{{ t('Collecting — needs at least two daily snapshots per fund.', '采集中 — 每只基金至少需要两个每日快照。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ======================= HEALTH ======================= -->
  <div class="panel span12" id="health">
    <h2>{{ t('Data health', '数据健康度') }}
      {{ help("Every data source this dashboard depends on. OK = fresh. STALE = no new data lately (signal confidence reduced automatically). FAILED = today's fetch broke (yesterday's data still used). BLOCKED = a known, documented limitation — not a malfunction. DEAD = failed 3+ runs and paused until it recovers.", "本仪表盘所依赖的每个数据源。OK = 新鲜。STALE = 近期无新数据（信号置信度已自动下调）。FAILED = 今日抓取失败（仍沿用昨日数据）。BLOCKED = 已知且有记录的限制 — 并非故障。DEAD = 连续 3 次以上失败，已暂停直至恢复。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('source', '数据源') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('status', '状态') }}</th><th>{{ t('rows', '行数') }}</th><th>{{ t('last data', '最新数据') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t('note', '备注') }}</th></tr>
      {% for s in health %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ s.name }}</td>
        <td class="l"><span class="pill pill-{{ s.status }}">{{ s.status }}</span></td>
        <td>{{ s.rows }}</td><td>{{ s.last_date or "—" }}</td>
        <td class="l muted">{{ s.error or "" }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted"><span class="l-en">A failed source never crashes the dashboard — affected signals just lose confidence until it heals.
       Generated {{ generated_utc }} UTC · <a href="brief.html">daily brief</a> ·
       <a href="history.html">history & charts</a> · <a href="validation_timeline.html">full 2007→ backtest</a></span><span class="l-zh">数据源失败绝不会让仪表盘崩溃 — 受影响的信号只是降低置信度，直到其恢复。
       生成于 {{ generated_utc }} UTC · <a href="brief.html">每日简报</a> ·
       <a href="history.html">历史与图表</a> · <a href="validation_timeline.html">完整 2007→ 回测</a></span></p>
  </div>

</div>
<script>
  // keep tooltips on-screen: open downward near the top, and anchor to the
  // nearest side when close to the left/right viewport edges
  document.addEventListener('mouseover', function (e) {
    var h = e.target.closest('.help');
    if (!h) return;
    var r = h.getBoundingClientRect();
    h.classList.toggle('below', r.top < 330);
    var tip = h.querySelector('.tip');
    var half = ((tip && tip.offsetWidth) || 290) / 2 + 16;
    h.classList.remove('edge-right', 'edge-left');
    if (r.left + r.width / 2 + half > window.innerWidth) h.classList.add('edge-right');
    else if (r.left + r.width / 2 - half < 0) h.classList.add('edge-left');
  });
</script>
<script>
  // Deep-link highlight: when an alert links to a scorecard (#liquidity, #credit,
  // …), smooth-scroll to that panel and pulse a glow so it's obvious which card
  // the alert came from — whether arriving from the landing hub (page load with
  // a #hash) or clicking an alert on this page.
  (function () {
    function flash(id) {
      var el = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!el) return;
      el.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
      el.classList.remove('flash');
      void el.offsetWidth;            // restart the animation on a re-click
      el.classList.add('flash');
      setTimeout(function () { el.classList.remove('flash'); }, 2600);
    }
    function fromHash() {
      var id = (location.hash || '').replace('#', '');
      if (id && document.getElementById(id)) setTimeout(function () { flash(id); }, 60);
    }
    window.addEventListener('load', fromHash);
    window.addEventListener('hashchange', fromHash);
    document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var a = e.target.closest('a.alert[href^="#"]');
      if (!a) return;
      var id = a.getAttribute('href').slice(1);
      // re-clicking when the hash is already set won't fire hashchange — flash now
      if (location.hash === '#' + id) { e.preventDefault(); flash(id); }
    });
  })();
</script>
<script>
/* Chinese-mode chart recolour + relabel map (baked chart colours are constants).
   Colour pairs are symmetric so the same map flips both ways; charts always
   render on dark slate so only these green/red + quad green/red hexes swap. */
window.__CHART_SWAP__ = {
  colors: {"#5fbf7f":"#e07070","#e07070":"#5fbf7f","#2e9e4f":"#d04545","#d04545":"#2e9e4f"},
  labels: {"growth":"增长","inflation":"通胀","net liquidity":"净流动性","4w RoC":"4周变化",
           "HY OAS %":"高收益债利差 %","% S&P500 > 50DMA":"标普500 高于50日均线 %"}
};
</script>
<script src="theme.js"></script>
<script src="chart_i18n.js"></script>
<script src="timemachine.js"></script>
<script src="tablesort.js"></script>
<script src="charts.js"></script>
